{"video":"OlnUxUvZVHE","lines":[{"t":[0,3.2],"en":"- Now this is called slacklining."},{"t":[3.2,5.2],"en":"I set up the old slackline to teach the office"},{"t":[5.2,7.8],"en":"the skills of focus and discipline."},{"t":[7.8,9.8],"en":"Or in the case of certain individuals,"},{"t":[9.8,13.2],"en":"the skills of humiliation and looking really dumb."},{"t":[13.2,15.9],"en":"Dwight Jr., this looks like your speed."},{"t":[15.9,17.3],"en":"- I guess I can give it a shot."},{"t":[17.3,19.4],"en":"- Yeah, come on, get up here."},{"t":[19.4,20.6],"en":"Just hop on up."},{"t":[20.6,22],"en":"- Okay."},{"t":[22,23.4],"en":"- Focus on the horizon."},{"t":[26.1,27.4],"en":"Whoa!"},{"t":[27.4,28.6],"en":"Look at this guy!"},{"t":[30,34.7],"en":"- I've always been good at anything that required balance."},{"t":[34.7,36.7],"en":"My doctor says I have gigantic inner ears."},{"t":[36.7,39.6],"en":"- Go Dwight Jr."},{"t":[39.6,41.5],"en":"- Yes!"},{"t":[41.5,42.9],"en":"- Unimpressed."},{"t":[42.9,45.4],"en":"It's a tightrope for babies, boo."},{"t":[45.4,46.3],"en":"- All right, let's see you do it."},{"t":[46.3,48.2],"en":"- All right, let me show you how a real man"},{"t":[48.2,49.9],"en":"walks across a flaccid cord."},{"t":[60,64.7],"en":"Who ordered the hot apple fail?"},{"t":[64.7,67],"en":"- Okay, I am just getting started, okay?"},{"t":[68.8,69.9],"en":"- You got this."},{"t":[69.9,70.8],"en":"This is all you."},{"t":[72.5,73.4],"en":"- Oh!"},{"t":[74.6,75.5],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[76.5,77.9],"en":"- We've got ourselves a yard sale."},{"t":[83,84.4],"en":"Ball's in face."},{"t":[84.4,85.5],"en":"- It's not a race, Dwight."},{"t":[85.5,86.3],"en":"- Oh no!"},{"t":[90,90.8],"en":"- Whoa!"},{"t":[90.8,92.1],"en":"- Well, it's official."},{"t":[92.1,95.4],"en":"Old Dwight is lame and new Dwight is cool."},{"t":[95.4,96.5],"en":"- That's not true."},{"t":[98.2,99.4],"en":"- Give me another chance."},{"t":[99.4,100.2],"en":"- But your mouth is--"},{"t":[100.2,101.2],"en":"- This is a bloodbath."},{"t":[101.2,102.7],"en":"All right, I'm calling this."},{"t":[102.7,103.6],"en":"- What?"},{"t":[103.6,104.6],"en":"- It's enough of this."},{"t":[104.6,106.1],"en":"Everyone, let's go back to work."},{"t":[106.1,107.8],"en":"- This is a stupid activity."},{"t":[107.8,109.7],"en":"I would be embarrassed to be good at it."},{"t":[116.6,117.4],"en":"Idiots."},{"t":[126.5,129.1],"en":"Slacklining, big deal."},{"t":[129.1,130.2],"en":"Untie that rope."},{"t":[130.2,132.3],"en":"Give it to a couple of pigtailed schoolgirls."},{"t":[132.3,134.5],"en":"Let them start jumping with it while chanting a rhyme"},{"t":[134.5,136.2],"en":"and giggling about boys."},{"t":[136.2,138.2],"en":"Doesn't seem so macho now, does it?"},{"t":[138.2,139.4],"en":"It's a jump rope."},{"t":[152.3,153.1],"en":"- Dwight!"},{"t":[156.3,157.1],"en":"- Pam?"},{"t":[157.1,158.4],"en":"Hey, I'm up here, up the ladder."},{"t":[158.4,159.3],"en":"Come on."},{"t":[162.3,163.5],"en":"What are you doing?"},{"t":[163.5,164.4],"en":"- Come here, I'll show you."},{"t":[164.4,169.2],"en":"Do you see how the trapeze completely surrounds the wire?"},{"t":[169.2,183.4],"en":"That means it is literally impossible for anyone to fall off."},{"t":[183.4,187.1],"en":"So you will merely sit below and be my counterweight as I pedal across the parking lot to that telephone pole."},{"t":[187.1,188],"en":"- I will."},{"t":[188,188.1],"en":"- You will."},{"t":[188.1,189.2],"en":"- Yeah, we weigh about the same, wouldn't you say?"},{"t":[189.2,190.3],"en":"- Sure, if you weigh 105 pounds."},{"t":[190.3,191.3],"en":"- So you'll do it?"},{"t":[191.3,191.4],"en":"- No."},{"t":[191.4,192.3],"en":"- Come on!"},{"t":[192.3,194.3],"en":"- This won't be the only thrill of your boring life."},{"t":[194.3,197.4],"en":"- Dwight, you may find this hard to believe, but I love my boring life."},{"t":[197.4,198.3],"en":"- Come on!"},{"t":[198.3,199.4],"en":"- Exactly the way it is."},{"t":[199.4,200.4],"en":"- No, Pam."},{"t":[200.4,201.4],"en":"- Yes!"},{"t":[201.4,205.5],"en":"And there's nothing you can say that would get me to run the slightest risk of losing it."},{"t":[205.5,206.5],"en":"- Please, please, Pam."},{"t":[206.5,207.5],"en":"- Find someone else."},{"t":[207.5,208.5],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[208.5,209.5],"en":"Ask Phyllis."},{"t":[209.5,210.5],"en":"- I can't use Phyllis."},{"t":[210.5,211.5],"en":"Are you kidding me?"},{"t":[211.5,213.5],"en":"The moment she steps off this bar, I'll be launched into space."},{"t":[213.5,214.5],"en":"God!"},{"t":[214.5,215.5],"en":"You're so insensitive."},{"t":[215.5,216.5],"en":"- Okay."},{"t":[216.5,217.5],"en":"All right."},{"t":[217.5,218.5],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[218.5,219.5],"en":"- Attention, employees!"},{"t":[219.5,220.5],"en":"- No, ask Phyllis."},{"t":[220.5,221.5],"en":"- No, ask Phyllis."},{"t":[221.5,222.5],"en":"- I can't use Phyllis."},{"t":[222.5,223.5],"en":"Are you kidding me?"},{"t":[223.5,225.5],"en":"The moment she steps off this bar, I'll be launched into space."},{"t":[225.5,226.5],"en":"God!"},{"t":[226.5,228.5],"en":"You're so insensitive!"},{"t":[228.5,230.5],"en":"- Okay."},{"t":[230.5,232.5],"en":"All right."},{"t":[232.5,235.5],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[235.5,239.5],"en":"- Attention, employees!"},{"t":[239.5,240.5],"en":"- No, ask Phyllis."},{"t":[240.5,241.5],"en":"- No, ask Phyllis."},{"t":[241.5,242.5],"en":"- I can't use Phyllis."},{"t":[242.5,243.5],"en":"Are you kidding me?"},{"t":[243.5,244.5],"en":"The moment she steps off this bar, I'll be launched into space."},{"t":[244.5,244.6],"en":"God!"},{"t":[244.6,245.5],"en":"You're so insensitive."},{"t":[245.5,247.5],"en":"He's a Dunder Mifflin."},{"t":[247.5,252.5],"en":"Everyone thinks the new guys are so cool, 'cause they can slackline."},{"t":[252.5,253.5],"en":"Ooh!"},{"t":[253.5,254.5],"en":"Hey, Clark."},{"t":[254.5,258.5],"en":"This is what a real salesman looks like."},{"t":[258.5,262.5],"en":"They say that you only live once, and I'm about to prove it."},{"t":[262.5,264.5],"en":"Dwight Schrute!"},{"t":[264.5,265.5],"en":"- Hi!"},{"t":[265.5,266.5],"en":"- Hey, man."},{"t":[266.5,267.5],"en":"It's Halpert."},{"t":[267.5,269.5],"en":"Did you go to the other guy yet?"},{"t":[269.5,270.5],"en":"Great."},{"t":[270.5,271.5],"en":"Don't."},{"t":[271.5,272.5],"en":"I'm in."},{"t":[274.5,275.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[275.5,276.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[276.5,277.5],"en":"Yep."},{"t":[277.5,278.5],"en":"I'm all in."},{"t":[278.5,279.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[279.5,280.5],"en":"Talk to you soon."},{"t":[280.5,281.5],"en":"Bye."},{"t":[281.5,286.5],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[286.5,291.5],"en":"Woohoo!"},{"t":[291.5,296.5],"en":"No! No!"},{"t":[296.5,299.5],"en":"Wait! Hold on!"},{"t":[299.5,302.5],"en":"Call somebody!"},{"t":[302.5,306.5],"en":"Hold on! Hold on, Dwight!"},{"t":[306.5,312.5],"en":"In the parking lot today there was a circus."},{"t":[312.5,314.5],"en":"Copier did tricks on the high wire."},{"t":[314.5,317.5],"en":"A lady tried to give away a baby that looked like a cat."},{"t":[317.5,321.5],"en":"There was a Dwight impersonator and a Jim impersonator."},{"t":[321.5,323.5],"en":"A strong man crushed a turtle."},{"t":[323.5,326.5],"en":"I laughed and I cried."},{"t":[326.5,330.5],"en":"Not bad for a day in the life of a dog food company."}]}
